1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Narrator: Listen to a principal talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:09,020
Principal: I wanted to tell you that the city is having a mural contest.

3
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:13,030
A mural will be painted on City Hall sometime this summer.

4
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:17,060
Each school in the city is sending in a mural design

5
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:20,040
and I'd like you to work as a group to do it.

6
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,270
I hope many of you are interested.

7
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:26,280
If you'd like to participate, then come speak with me now.

8
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:30,120
Otherwise, you can go home.
